            <description><![CDATA[<p>Keep DITT ready after every restart.</p>
<ul>
<li>The final setup screen now offers a Launch DITT when I log in switch, without adding another step.</li>
<li>Your choice is saved with setup and applied only when you press Start DITT.</li>
<li>Existing login settings stay in place. Settings reflects macOS approval status and explains how to resolve a failed registration.</li>
</ul>
<p>Requires macOS 14 or later. Preview 10 users can install from Settings → Updates.</p>
]]></description>
